# This file keeps the empty `images/` folder in the template.
#
# PUBLIC FOLDER — put every image and icon the prototype uses here:
# icons exported from Figma, logos, illustrations, UI screenshots.
# Subfolders are fine, e.g. `images/icons/close.svg`.
#
# This folder is committed and deployed, so paths like
# `<img src="images/icons/close.svg">` work on the live link.
#
# Do not use `assets/` for these (local-only, never deploys) and do not
# add a root-level `public/` folder (Vercel would serve it as the whole site).
